  <Strings>
    <Section>Story</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>12904</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Ines&gt;の腕力は
機械人である自分に匹敵する</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Ines&gt;'s strength is comparable to that of a mechanoid.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>13028</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>一体、どうやって
あれだけの出力を
しぼり出しているのだ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>How is she physically able to exert such force?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>13152</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>これはボクの推測だけど……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm just guessing, but...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>13244</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Ines&gt;の怪力の源は？
・あの胸が怪しい！
・&lt;Ines&gt;は機械人なんだ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The source of &lt;Ines&gt;'s strength?
・Her chest is real sus, right?
・She must be a mechanoid too!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>13384</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あの胸が怪しいね！
きっとあの巨大な胸は
筋肉のカタマリなんだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Her chest is real sus, right? They're probably just huge lumps of pure muscle!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>13764</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>何!?
そんな事がありえるのか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What?! Is that physically possible?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>14092</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>さぁねぇ……
触ってみればわかると思うけど？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I dunno. Maybe your could give 'em a feel and find out?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>14216</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>了解。確認してくる</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Understood. Seeking confirmation.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>15344</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ほ、報告。
&lt;Ines&gt;の胸は、その柔軟性から
判断して筋肉ではない</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>S-Status report. &lt;Ines&gt;'s chest cannot be pure muscles based on their texture.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>15580</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>だが、彼女のパワーと
密接な因果関係を持つ模様……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>However, these was some clear correlation between them and her power...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>15704</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>胸に触れた瞬間、繰り出された
&lt;Ines&gt;の攻撃は
自分の耐久力を大きく上回り……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The instant I touched her chest, her attack greatly exceeded my physical limits...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>16660</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>うわわぁぁぁ〜!?
&lt;Kunzite&gt;、しっかりぃ〜っ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Whoa-oh?! &lt;Kunzite&gt;, stay with me!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>17104</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Ines&gt;は機械人なんだ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>She must be a mechanoid too!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>17432</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>む!?　……まさか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What?! Could it be?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>17760</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ボクは聞いた事があるんだ。
&lt;Ines&gt;が、人をコキ使って
お金をもうけようとする時</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I've heard it, you know. When she's trying to scam people outta their money...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>17884</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>頭の中から
『カチャカチャ、チーン』って
計算する音が響くのをね！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You can hear the “chakachaka” of her doing calculations in her head!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>18008</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>それにボクをいじめる時の
あの嬉しそうな目……あの
冷たさは機械どころじゃないよ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Have you ever seen the delight in her eyes when she bullies me? Only a machine could be so cold!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>18324</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あれは魔女の目だね！
&lt;Ines&gt;の正体は、冷酷非道の
オッパイ魔女なんだ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>She's got the eyes of a witch, I tell you! Her true identity must be that of a cold-blooded, busty witch!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>19396</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あれ!?
どこ行くの、&lt;Kunzite&gt;……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Huh?! &lt;Kunzite&gt;, where are you going...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>19948</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ぎゃあぁ〜〜〜っ！
その目だよぉぉぉ〜〜〜っ!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>AAHH! THOSE ARE THE EYES I'M TALKING ABOUT!!!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
